# Findings reviewed and knowingly accepted. Every entry names its drop
# condition; the weekly supply-chain sweep is the review point. No bare
# catch-alls — the gate stays actionable for anything not listed here.
#
# No accepted findings. The runtime image does not ship pip: the Dockerfile
# removes pip, its dist-info, and ensurepip after the hash-checked install,
# in the same layer. Advisories against libraries vendored inside pip
# (msgpack, urllib3, certifi) and the SBOM-attributed setuptools finding are
# not in the image, so they are not ignored here. A new finding needs its own
# reviewed entry with a drop condition — do not restore a blanket pip-vendor
# exception.
